What to do
----------
1. Update joseph. From the Mac:

     ssh root@joseph.tailf69bc5.ts.net
     apt update && apt dist-upgrade

2. If the list above has a proxmox-kernel package, reboot so the new
   kernel is used. Every guest restarts with it:

     reboot

   Give hermit a few minutes to come back up.

3. After a reboot, unseal Vault. From the Mac:

     cd ~/mediasafe-gitops
     export BW_SESSION="$(bw unlock --raw)"
     export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/homelab.yaml
     bootstrap/vault-unseal

   It prints "Unsealed." when done. If it says it could not read Vault's
   status, Vault isn't up yet: wait a minute and run the last line again.
